@startuml Feature5_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 5: Authentication - Sequence: Login & Token Generation**

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nAuthController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nAuthService" as Svc
participant "<<service>>\nEncodeService" as Encode
participant "<<service>>\nJwtService" as Jwt
participant "<<repository>>\nUserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "<<repository>>\nUserAuthTokenRepository" as TokenRepo
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Enter Email & Password
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/auth/login
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: LoginAsync(email, password)
activate Svc

Svc -> UserRepo: GetByEmail(email)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo --> Svc: return User
deactivate UserRepo

Svc -> Encode: SHA256WithSalt(password, "salt")
activate Encode
Encode --> Svc: return passwordHash
deactivate Encode

note right of Svc: Validate passwordHash\nand check Status != Disabled

Svc -> UserRepo: TouchLastLoginAsync(userId)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo --> Svc: ok
deactivate UserRepo

Svc -> Svc: IssueTokensAsync(user)

Svc -> Jwt: GenerateTokens(userId, email, roles...)
activate Jwt
Jwt --> Svc: return (accessToken, refreshToken)
deactivate Jwt

Svc -> TokenRepo: InsertAsync(tokenEntity)
activate TokenRepo
TokenRepo -> DbContext: Add & SaveChanges
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: Execute SQL INSERT
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: success
deactivate DB
DbContext --> TokenRepo: success
deactivate DbContext
TokenRepo --> Svc: success
deactivate TokenRepo

Svc --> Ctrl: return LoginResult
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON (Access/Refresh Tokens)
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> User: Navigate to Dashboard
deactivate UI
@enduml
